From: stefan <46031448+StefanPetersTM@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 23:17:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] cleanup: remove embedded primer diagnostics after CP3114

Keep the opt-in primer transport and compatibility behavior while deleting default-off MAC and user-plane traces from production files. The successful CP3114 path does not require these observers.
